// Comparison pages (compare.jsx): Elchi vs the enterprise ADCs and software load balancers
// F5 BIG-IP, NetScaler, A10 Thunder, VMware Avi, HAProxy Enterprise, F5 NGINX Plus and
// Progress Kemp LoadMaster, and vs the cloud-native gateways and meshes Istio, Envoy Gateway, Kong
// Gateway, kgateway and Contour, plus the hub that summarises them. The retired
// go-control-plane page is a redirect stub in public/compare/ (go-control-plane is a
// library Elchi itself is built on, not a competitor).
//
// Fact rules for this file:
// - Elchi cells come from this repo's docs (docs-site/docs) and products-data.js.
// - Every competitor cell is backed by one of the page's `sources` (official docs or
//   the project's own repository), checked on REVIEWED. If a claim cannot be backed
//   by an official source, it is left out. No competitor prices: license models are
//   described, never priced.
// - The ADC, Kong Gateway, kgateway and Contour pages also carry `cellSources`: the source
//   URL(s) behind each competitor cell, keyed by criterion. Not rendered; it is the
//   audit trail for the next review.
// - Technical terms stay in English in the Turkish copy.

// Date the competitor facts were last checked. A page or the hub can carry its own
// `reviewed` when it was checked on a different day.
