    ha: 'HA pairs of two Elchi OS appliances, active/passive, sharing VIPs over gratuitous ARP or BGP (with BFD). Measured takeover is about 2 s on power-off and about 50 ms on a planned failover, with no split brain on a heartbeat partition. There is no active/active mode. The management plane runs several controllers with leader election.',
