        agent: 'No host agent. kgateway deploys an Envoy Deployment and Service for each Gateway, or binds a self-managed proxy you deploy yourself; proxies pull configuration from the kgateway xDS server.',
        rbac: 'Kubernetes RBAC and namespaces on the Gateway API and kgateway resources. Route delegation lets parent and child HTTPRoutes split routing across teams and namespaces.',
